Within this repo folder are all the input files needed to run an example for the Eastern California Bay Area. 
The model run is the same as the "Connected Uniform" model from Marschall et al. 2026 preprint (Submitted to BSSA) https://eartharxiv.org/repository/view/15691/

Files in the folder.

run_bay_Qworxs.in: this is the main input file, for the example I have set the WriteParams (WriteSlip, WriteStress, etc) to zero because these files can be quite large and are not needed for basic catalog analysis.
East_Bay_Updated_Connected_HSR3.flt: This is the fault file with triangular elements and sliprates
neighbor_connected_updated.txt: Neighbor file of nearby elements in the fault file.





